<body>
  <div class="container-fluid mt-3 mx-auto w-75">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-12">
        <a href="/projects"> < Go Back! </a>
        <article>
          <h1 class="mt-3"><%= title %></h1>
          <p>2020 - 2024</p>
          <hr>

          <p>
            A project I joined in 2020 that aimed for better accessibility for Vertically Scrolling Rhythm Game (VSRG) content through the ROBLOX
            platform. 
            <br><br>
            Managed by the "RoVSRG" Organization, it initially was created as a community fork in 2017 to share 
            VSRG content for PC and Mobile devices and was made open-source starting 2020 (however it is now defunct).
            <br><br>
            LUAU (A modified version of LUA) is used as default for the game engine, while Python was used to automate specific tasks (e.g.,
            JSON/YAML file handling for thousands of asset files).
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
